Subject: ASUS I007 USB device mode: CDC-NCM network ue0 (169.254.7.2) and the live log

Boot-arg asususb=1 reports the DWC3 state, asususb=2 runs the device (default 0: nothing).
Ported from sweet 0072-0077 (CDC-ECM) to the SM8350 and to NCM + MS OS "WINNCM" for Windows.

